    "detailed_description": "In this fast-paced rogue-lite, your health points are your only resource: sacrifice them to acquire vampiric powers and devour your enemies to heal yourself! Beware: every drop of blood counts in this frantic race to defeat the apostles of the Cult of the Sun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/b820840fb7dd809ab2a54f326dbb9ac4.poster.avif?t=1747136040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/b820840fb7dd809ab2a54f326dbb9ac4.webm?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/b820840fb7dd809ab2a54f326dbb9ac4.mp4?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play as a young vampire who realizes that the days are getting longer, and tries to find the cause. His steps lead him to the Cult of the Sun, who are preparing a ritual to make the day permanent! A fierce fight begins: use your bloodthirsty powers to fight your way to the high authorities of the Cult, and stop the ritual!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/ca566dd9e4f7d3aa72bc0efbd9ec83d8.poster.avif?t=1747136040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/ca566dd9e4f7d3aa72bc0efbd9ec83d8.webm?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/ca566dd9e4f7d3aa72bc0efbd9ec83d8.mp4?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game is all about risk and reward. Get upgrades to get stronger; but you'll have to pay them with your own life! Find the right balance between being strong and staying alive!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/72f1a1a7c5eda550b8e9baf59e92b158.poster.avif?t=1747136040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/72f1a1a7c5eda550b8e9baf59e92b158.webm?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/72f1a1a7c5eda550b8e9baf59e92b158.mp4?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Demo content</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 different enemies<br></li><li>1 boss and 1 mini boss<br></li><li>25+ unique upgrades<br></li><li>Fast paced runs, about 5 to 10 minutes each<br></li><li>Hand drawn characters, backgrounds and illustrations<br></li><li>Unique runs, replay value</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Full release content</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>40+ different enemies<br></li><li>4 bosses<br></li><li>200+ unique upgrades<br></li><li>Fast paced runs, about 30 minutes each<br></li><li>Hand drawn characters, backgrounds and illustrations<br></li><li>Meta-game progression<br></li><li>Unique runs, great replay value</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "In this fast-paced rogue-lite, your health points are your only resource: sacrifice them to acquire vampiric powers and devour your enemies to heal yourself! Beware: every drop of blood counts in this frantic race to defeat the apostles of the Cult of the Sun!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/b820840fb7dd809ab2a54f326dbb9ac4.poster.avif?t=1747136040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/b820840fb7dd809ab2a54f326dbb9ac4.webm?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/b820840fb7dd809ab2a54f326dbb9ac4.mp4?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Play as a young vampire who realizes that the days are getting longer, and tries to find the cause. His steps lead him to the Cult of the Sun, who are preparing a ritual to make the day permanent! A fierce fight begins: use your bloodthirsty powers to fight your way to the high authorities of the Cult, and stop the ritual!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/ca566dd9e4f7d3aa72bc0efbd9ec83d8.poster.avif?t=1747136040\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/ca566dd9e4f7d3aa72bc0efbd9ec83d8.webm?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2502310/extras/ca566dd9e4f7d3aa72bc0efbd9ec83d8.mp4?t=1747136040\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This game is all about risk and reward. Get upgrades to get stronger; but you'll have to pay them with your own life! Find the right balance between being strong and